"Not enough free picklight locations. %(required)s are required, but only "
"%(available)s are available."
msgstr "空闲的电子标签库位不足。需要 %(required)s 个，但仅有 %(available)s 个可用。"

#. module: sn_wsd_picklight
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sn_wsd_picklight/models/stock_move.py:0
